I, consistent with a time a little past 11:30.\n- **Minute hand (long, black):** Pointing just past VI toward VII, i.e., about 32 minutes.\n- **Second hand (red):** Straight up at XII, i.e., 00 seconds.\n\nSo the displayed time is **11:32:00**.<|im_end|>",
